// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig, then replace the empty values.
// Secrets.xcconfig is ignored by Git. Do not commit real credentials.
// (No dandanplay AppSecret here: production goes through the OcPlay gateway,
//  which holds the AppSecret server-side. The client only needs a gateway URL +
//  API Key, configured in-app under Settings → 弹幕.)

